// The GCC overflow builtins, ovf_names[i] the operation ovf_ops[i] (0 add, 1 sub, 2 mul).
// The generic spellings take the types of their operands and of the object the
// result goes in, and have ovf_info[i] -1; a typed spelling (s: int, sl and sll:
// long, u: unsigned, ul and ull: unsigned long) has the info of its one type, its
// size in bytes times two plus one when it is signed. A call is rewritten
// (mid/pass/frame/ovf) into one of c___c2id_ovf in rt/ext/builtin/ovf.id.
